
			   GNU zebra OSPFd

			    December 1998

GNU zebra OSPFd is planning to support OSPF version 2.  We also have
plan of support of IPv6 (it may be as a deferent daemon).  Crrent code
is developing version and don't have full functionality of OSPF.

GNU zebra OSPFd is developing by

Hannes Boehm <hannes@boehm.org>
Yasuhiro Ohara <yasu@sfc.wide.ad.jp>
Toshiaki Takada <takada@zebra.org>
Kunihiro Ishiguro <kunihiro@zebra.org>

If you have any question and comments.  Please write to
ospfd@zebra.org.
--
Kunihiro Ishiguro <kunihiro@zebra.org>
